Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 09:06:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] Replace GPU governor/min-max control with OPP-index freq
 lock

devfreq governor and min/max freq are effectively no-ops on this
gpufreqv2 legacy DVFS chip (GPUEB Off, confirmed by careful A/B
retesting). Add TYPE_GPU_OPP_INDEX, backed by the /proc/gpufreqv2
fix_target_opp_index debug node, which pins the real OPP index and
responds immediately. Falls back to the old kgsl/devfreq discovery
paths when that node is not present.

See kernellamu-gpu-governor-kernel-manager memory for the
measurements that led here.

Change-Id: I82a495ee9fea29cbc73c91309dab4bf7f981fee8
